    "text": "Trump then reminded reporters that he played a critical role in getting McConnell to leave GOP leadership and said the disgraced RINO is voting against his nominees out of pure spite.\n“I was the one that got McConnell to drop out of the leadership position,” Trump pointed out. “He’s not voting against Bobby [Kennedy], he’s voting against me. He’s a very bitter guy.”\n“But we have a very strong party, and he’s lost his power. It’s affected his vote.” Right on!",
